  "text": " I see a couple on a blanket, having what looks like a picnic. They have their blanket and their radio. And I see the opion lady is pouring a drink and the gentleman is reading a book. There's a kite being flown by another fellow and the dog is right in front of him having a good time. And I see there the other the other the gentleman is flying a kite. Somebody is out in the water with a slip little sailboat while somebody is unsure bent over perhaps on a rock close by the water. There's a big giant tree in the background with a car and it looks like he's going into the garage. I can see a little bucket over there also in the lower right hand side. The background looks like it could be a wooded area around the lake.",
